#: src/TextClient.cpp
msgid ""
"Give the number of a file as listed by 'results', optionally followed by a search id.\n"
"Without an id, the number refers to the last 'results' output, or to the most recently started search if nothing was listed yet.\n"
"Example: 'download 12' downloads file 12 of the last results; 'download 12 3' downloads file 12 of search 3.\n"
